{"id":851555,"title":"10｜DeepSeek R1的思考与启发","content":"邱锡鹏老师在CCF报告中对R1/R1-zero进行了深入分析。R1通过直接蒸馏而非搜索实现了与O1相似的效果，表明强大的基模型是关键。尽管R1强调MCTS无明显效果，但简单的多数投票仍能提升其性能，显示搜索的重要性。R1的成功依赖于高效的系统和RL调教能力，涉及多种技巧。策略初始化方面，R1-zero尝试了不使用SFT的方法，但仍需SFT作为基础。奖励模型设计上，R1并未有显著创新，但其RL设计值得肯定。PRM和MCTS的尝试虽未成功，但提供了有价值的参考。R1在写作能力上表现出色，可能与其较少的安全对齐有关。过度优化问题导致数据量不足时出现过拟合。Test-Time Scaling的重要性被强调，但预训练仍是基础。R1展示了强推理和联网搜索的能力，未来可能以agent形式落地，但鲁棒性仍需提升。总体而言，R1并非最优解，但为后续研究提供了重要方向。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397718,"user_name":"云居麒","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1075658,"ip_address":"天津","ucode":"03BEECD7B8259E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/69/ca/ab7cbac4.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739416728,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144293,"content":"不提供PPT哈","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1739424012,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397718,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100968801,"comment_content":"ppt有吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657128,"discussion_content":"不提供PPT哈","content_length":7,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1739424012,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}